1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,350
Everyone at the gym is guessing weights and counting sets.

2
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:13,170
Here is how FitLoop lets your own AI agent coach your workouts and meals across iPhone, Apple Watch, and Even G2 glasses.

3
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:18,600
Connect Claude or any MCP agent to FitLoop with a single tap.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:24,850
Your agent fetches the plan guide and your profile to craft a customized weekly routine.

5
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:32,300
FitLoop validates every exercise, rest timer, and rep count against strict glasses-friendly limits.

6
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:38,480
Once validated, your agent publishes the plan, instantly syncing to your devices.

7
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:45,160
On your phone, the Today tab displays your full morning session, from goblet squats to meals.

8
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:51,610
Tap into any movement to preview procedural exercise animations and coaching cues.

9
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:57,580
When you start, your Apple Watch tracks your workout session and streams live heart rate.

10
00:00:57,580 --> 00:01:03,350
Check off sets as you finish them, and the rest timer automatically counts down.

11
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:08,870
Take your workout completely hands-free by pairing your Even G2 glasses.

12
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:15,820
A crisp nine-line green display shows your active exercise, target reps, and live heart rate.

13
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:21,620
Single tap your R1 smart ring to log your set and trigger the rest countdown.

14
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:27,470
Hold the ring to view form cues, or tap out instant feedback if something hurts.

15
00:01:27,470 --> 00:01:33,440
If your knee twinges during lunges, select It hurts right from your glasses or phone.

16
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:39,240
At lunch, check off your meal, adjusting whether you ate more, less, or swapped dishes.

17
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:45,970
Your agent reads your check-ins and notes over MCP, and replies with helpful adjustments.

18
00:01:45,970 --> 00:01:52,570
Tomorrow's plan automatically swaps out squats for step-ups, keeping you safe and on track.

19
00:01:52,570 --> 00:01:56,720
Your agent coaches. FitLoop keeps you on the plan.

20
00:01:56,720 --> 00:02:00,550
FitLoop. Smarter training, right in your vision.
